<?xml version="1.0"?>
<sdf version="1.6">
  <!--
    Blue circular insertion socket.

    The green insertion cylinder diameter is 0.045 m and height is 0.100 m.
    The socket inner diameter is intentionally relaxed to 0.055 m so perception noise does not dominate the insertion experiments.
    The socket uses a 48-segment ring so it looks close to a smooth circular
    hole while still providing collision walls for insertion.

    Approximate dimensions:
      - inner diameter: 0.055 m
      - outer diameter: 0.105 m
      - height: 0.100 m

    Convention:
      - model origin is the center of the circular hole at table surface;
      - spawn pose z should be the table/support surface height;
      - insertion target is the model origin in x/y.
  -->
